      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. but the foundation we're applying to is pretty old-school and they really value 'stability' and 'control.' can you add some more scientific weight to the argument? specifically, show how managed conservation's attempts to control nature actually cause more long-term damage than just letting it go wild.",
